# The Deck (Weissman, Summer 1996)
# COMMUNITY / PERIOD DECK — not a MicroProse deck. The Deck — Brian Weissman's control deck, the
#   version he published for that date (Menendian, "The History of The Deck") — Brian Weissman.
# archetype: The Deck — Brian Weissman's control deck, the version he published for that date
#   (Menendian, "The History of The Deck")
# designer: Brian Weissman
# year: Summer 1996
# caveat: 58-card maindeck as Menendian prints it
# source: https://www.vintagemagic.com/blog/old-school-magic-chapter-2-the-history-of-the-deck/
#   — Chapter 2 | Old School Magic — "Summer of 1996 was known as Necro Summer, but Necro decks
#   could do little more than play weenie hordes and attempt to Disk away Moat or force a
#   discard before it could be played. Brian competed in the Origins, 96 Team Tournaments, to
#   victory with this weapon: / The Deck, Summer, 1996" [Tier-web — Stephen Menendian's "Old
#   School Magic" series, vintagemagic.com; no local copy exists]
# group: Community decks
